The Georgian line attached „-ს" with a hyphen („გია საცდელი-ს") and closed
the quote with a plain ". It now declines the name with geoName (dative)
and closes with “, as Georgian text does. Still behind NEED_RECALL_ON =
false; BR in NIGHT_QUESTIONS shows the corrected text for Misho's yes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
